************ REST API ****************************

Representational state transfer api

API - help to communicate bw different systems

Rest uses http methods to perform operations i.e CRUD operations


Features:
-They are stateless
-Work on Client-Server architecture


Http Methods :
-Get
-Post
-Update/PUT
-Delete
-Patch (when partial infor needs to be updated like only age )



************ Monolithic VS Micro-Service Architecture ****************************

1.Monolithic Architecture

it has a single unit for storing entire program

ef we have an e commerce website so 

-shopping UI
-Payment gateway
-checkout page
-order page
-cart
-discount service
.....

it has a single codebase

Users -> LB -> App -> Db

So for simple sites


2.Mircoservice arch:

It divides application into different components

                    - Shop UI            - DB, Messaging queue
User -> API Gateway - Payment gateway    - DB
                    - Order service      -DB


